  m_text: "<b><align=\"center\">How to play</align></b>\n\nUse \"<b>WSAD</b>\" to
    move. Use \"<b>Space</b>\" to dash. Use \"<b>L-Shift</b>\" to sprint.\n<b>Aim</b>
    with your mouse cursor.\nExplore and gather <b>resources</b> in nearby <b>buildings</b>.
    \nCraft items from gathered resources at the <b>Crafting Table</b>.\nSave your
    progress by <b>sleeping</b>.\nSurvive the <b>night wave</b>.\nCraft an <b>emergency
    radio</b> to call for help and escape."
